WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Multiplying in rows

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:09.833
Father planted coffee seedlings in rows on the farm. Every row has the same number of seedlings.

3
00:00:09.833 --> 00:00:14.500
There are three rows, with five seedlings in each row.

4
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.300
Five, ten, fifteen.

5
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.833
Three times five equals fifteen.

6
00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:26.700
When we turn it around, there are five rows of three; it is still fifteen.
